伏羲 (Fuxi) IDE：控制论驱动的代码自治空间

伏羲 (Fuxi) 是一款基于 控制论 (Cybernetics) 与 三爻治理 (Trigram Governance) 理念构建的下一代开发环境。它不仅是一个代码编辑器，更是一个具备“自我感知、逻辑一致、故障自愈”能力的智能代码自治实体。

通过将 Python 的高层编排能力与 Rust 的高性能 Native 底座结合，伏羲 IDE 实现了极高并发下的“零拷贝”协作，是专为 AI 辅助编程与超大规模重构打造的生产力底座。核心哲学

伏羲 IDE 的运行逻辑遵循一套动态的自然律动：“始于规矩，行于 OT；否极则退，亢龙知止；解之以序，鼎新以智”。我们不再通过被动的指令驱动系统，而是通过治理逻辑使系统在复杂性熵增中保持有序。能力矩阵 (Capability Matrix)
能力属性	   架构层级	                      物理实现	            治理原语 (Governance Primitive)
强一致性	   Native OT Engine (Rust)	      True OT 转换矩阵	    泰 (Tài)：维持稳态平衡
高吞吐并发	 Buffer-Worker (Actor Model)	  异步 Sequencer 队列	  行云流水：去中心化调度
自愈能力     Snapshot Forest + Oplog	      ACID事务性恢复	      否极泰来：熔断与回滚
语义感知	   Tree-sitter + Symbol Indexer	  增量 AST 解析	        明察秋毫：语义切片提取
系统稳健性   Governance Controller	        三爻变易 FSM	        亢龙有悔：负载退避削峰
工程视角	   Dependency Graph	              符号注册表 + 邻接边	  解之以序：依赖关系的治理
架构概览
大脑 (Governance Layer)：Python Orchestrator，负责路由分发、状态机决策与故障熔断。
心脏 (Compute Core)：Rust Native Engine，负责 OT 转换、AST 增量解析，以及高性能内存管理。
神经系统 (Neural-Net Indexer)：持久化符号索引 (Sled + Graph)，支持毫秒级全项目符号查找。
全息视觉 (Observability)：实时 WebSocket 遥测总线，将 IDE 内部卦象状态可视化投射至仪表盘。
治理卦象体系 (Governance Matrix)

系统通过实时监控内部“熵值 (Entropy)”，自动演化为不同的治理卦象：
【乾】(Qian): 系统健康，算力充沛，响应速率 < 2ms。
【震】(Zhen): 负载激增，自动触发削峰填谷 (Throttling)，确保 UI 响应不阻塞。
【坎】(Kan): 依赖索引重组中，AI 上下文查询暂挂。
【蛊】(Gu): 逻辑冲突检测，自动执行快照回滚并进入诊断模式。
快速开始1. 编译与打包

伏羲 IDE 采用 Taskfile 管理自动化流水线：
# 铸造 Native 计算引擎
task build-core

# 生成通信契约
task gen-proto

# 封箱发布 (构建单一二进制文件)
task package
2. 启动
# 启动 IDE
./dist/fuxi-ide

# 查看实时治理仪表盘

工程宣言

伏羲 IDE 是一次架构上的“降维打击”。它拒绝了传统编辑器线性的调用链，转而追求“圆心环状”的共振架构。每一行代码的变化都在 OT 引擎中纠缠，每一次重构都在治理控制器的呵护下完成。



Fuxi IDE: Cybernetic Autonomous Code Space

Fuxi is a next-generation development environment built on the principles of Cybernetics (Control Theory) and Trigram Governance (I Ching logic). It is not merely a code editor; it is a self-governing, autonomous, and self-healing intelligent system.

By bridging the gap between high-performance Rust execution and Python-based logic orchestration, Fuxi creates a "Code Space" that maintains logical consistency (True OT) and system homeostasis (Cybernetic Governance) even under the most extreme concurrency.核心哲学 (Core Philosophy)

The architecture follows the evolution from Taiji (the Single Source of Truth) to Liangyi (Binary Logic/OT Entanglement), organized by the Wu Xing (Five Elements of Functional Modules), and regulated by Trigrams (Governance States). Fuxi does not execute commands—it governs code evolution.Key Capabilities (Capability Matrix)
Capability	         Architectural Layer	       Implementation	              Governance Primitive
Strict Consistency   Native OT Engine (Rust)     True OT Matrix	              Tai (泰): Balanced State
High Concurrency	   Buffer-Worker (Actors)	     Asynchronous Sequencer	      Flow (行云流水): Event Ring
Self-Healing	       Snapshot Forest + Oplog	   ACID Transactional Recovery	Fou Ji Tai Lai (否极泰来): Fault Fusion
Semantic Cognition	 Tree-sitter + AST Indexer	 Incremental AST Parsing	    Ming Cha Qiu Hao (明察秋毫): Semantic Slicing
System Robustness	   Governance Controller	     Trigram State Machine (FSM)	Kang Long You Hui (亢龙有悔): Throttling
Engineering View	   Global Dependency Graph	   Symbol Registry + Edges	    Jie Zhi Yi Xu (解之以序): Dependency Governance
Architectural Overview

Brain (Governance Layer): Python Orchestrator managing FSM-based governance policies.
Heart (Compute Engine): Rust Native Engine handling high-frequency OT transformations and incremental AST parsing.
Nervous System (Neural-Net Indexer): Persistent Symbol Graph (via sled) for sub-millisecond dependency resolution.
Consciousness (Observability): Real-time WebSocket Telemetry bus for visualizing "Hexagram States."

The Trigram Governance Model

The system monitors its own "Entropy" and "Conflict Rates," transitioning between states to ensure system integrity:
[Qian - 乾]: Healthy / Peak Performance.
[Zhen - 震]: High Load / Processing / Throttling required.
[Kan - 坎]: Blocked / Dependency Indexing in progress.
[Gu - 蛊]: Fault / Logic Divergence / Triggering Rollback.

Quick Start1. Build and Package

Fuxi uses Taskfile for unified automation:
# Forge the Native Engine
task build-core

# Generate ICAA Contracts (Protobuf)
task gen-proto

# Package into a Single Binary
task package
2. Execution
# Launch Fuxi
./dist/fuxi-ide

# Observe Governance Dashboard
# Open http://localhost:18766 in your browser
Engineering Manifesto

Fuxi IDE represents the convergence of Control Theory and Software Engineering. It treats codebases as living organisms. Through its OT-driven consistency and Trigram-based fault management, it eliminates the traditional overhead of manual debugging and manual code synchronization.
